<h2>Quick Start</h2>

<h3>1. Register a User</h3>
<pre><code>POST /api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass"
}</code></pre>

<h3>2. Login</h3>
<pre><code>POST /api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass"
}</code></pre>

<h3>3. Create an Expense</h3>
<pre><code>POST /api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer &lt;your-token&gt;
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Grocery shopping",
  "amount": 85.50,
  "date": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "category": "Food"
}</code></pre>

<h3>4. Get All Expenses</h3>
<pre><code>GET /api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer &lt;your-token&gt;</code></pre>